			"notes": "### ProjectFlint v0.30.3-b → v0.31.19\n\n* Added the **Sanding Station**, opening the next stage of Wood Age progression.\n* Added new **sanded, woven, filed, leather, and advanced glass** processing recipes.\n* Added new **water-storage progression**, including the **Water Bearing Pot**.\n* Added **Recipe Parchments** to improve recipe and progression guidance.\n* Expanded the **primitive kitchen**, including cabinets and additional food-storage functionality.\n* Overhauled the **Minecraft title screen** with ProjectFlint branding and a custom panorama.\n* Added rotating title-screen messages for **BTW, GT:NH, and TFC**.\n* Cleaned up the title screen, including unwanted **Realms-related UI**.\n* Fixed the **Stone Plant Cutters** recipe still requiring its older, more expensive ingredients.\n* Fixed numerous **recipe, UI, rendering, progression, and compatibility issues**.\n* Additional **bug fixes, balancing, and general polish** through **v0.31.19**."
